  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="93136e8c-aab9-46b5-809e-92dca8685ecf"><problem><para>
      <para>Choose the standard form of the quadratic expression.</para>
        <para> \((x+4)(x-1)\)</para>
          </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(x^2-3x+4\)</para><para>\(-x^2+3x-4\)</para><para>\(x^2+3x-4\)</para><para>\(-x^2-3x+4\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(x^2+3x-4\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(x^2+3x-4\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
